  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following elements $\\mathrm{In}, \\mathrm{Tl}, \\mathrm{Al}, \\mathrm{Pb}, \\mathrm{Sn}$ and Ge .\nThe most stable oxidation states of elements with highest and lowest first ionisation enthalpies, respectively, are",
