  "solution": {
    "text": "Among $\\mathrm{Al}, \\mathrm{In}, \\mathrm{Tl}, \\mathrm{Ge}, \\mathrm{Sn}, \\mathrm{Pb}$, the metal having highest $\\mathrm{IE}_1$ is Ge and lowest $\\mathrm{IE}_1$ is In .\nMost stable oxidation state of Ge is +4 and In is +3 .",
